up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "214771348", "author": {"steamid": "76561199140123049", "personaname": "Ohsamer Binti Ladin", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199140123049/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 11124, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1005, "last_played": 1776785284, "avatar": "d0a1a12327d2a881903d7ae3f63df353588b89af"}, "language": "english", "review": "After finishing Elden Ring. I decided to give this a try with my girl and a friend of mine and honestly, it has been nothing but relieve. After losing probably about 40 tries, killing the bosses has given me nothing but clarity. I'd rate it 10/10. Would recommend to kids under 8 with anger issues and psychopathic", "timestamp_created": 1767219529, "timestamp_updated": 1767219529, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "214770612", "author": {"steamid": "76561198004057488", "personaname": "Voimahurri", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198004057488/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 58, "playtime_forever": 49514, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 47854, "last_played": 1788983707, "avatar": "2e711e6cfeb381303322641c609ff48dd1cf31e0"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game. Buggy as all hell.\n\nThere's basically nothing you can do to fix any of it, either. Disconnects and CTD are common, the game has  zero customization options for PC (especially mouse and keyboard, half of the keybinds I want to use aren't possible for whatever reason), the UI is god awful and will get you killed (the ultimate gauge will look full at any point above 85% charge and you will look at it and think you have it, only to stand around and die to something stupid because it isn't charged), targeting a specific enemy is just ass and its impossible to predict which enemy you will lock onto, and the relic gambling is just painfully awful.\n\nSo much potential, wasted. Needs mods desperately, but the anticheat is hot garbage, too, because of course. So the game performs like ♥♥♥♥, no matter your hardware.", "timestamp_created": 1767218779, "timestamp_updated": 1785749310, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.416666656732559204", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "214769487", "author": {"steamid": "76561199090713665", "personaname": "Glorbacus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199090713665/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 86, "playtime_forever": 524, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 199, "last_played": 1788126845, "avatar": "e61b6d6c317eea531b4b6ad3ac79be64ccd4f204"}, "language": "english", "review": "looo", "timestamp_created": 1767217634, "timestamp_updated": 1767217634, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "214769184", "author": {"steamid": "76561197968101812", "personaname": "Blacktide", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/blacktide77/", "num_games_owned": 230, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 475, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 475, "last_played": 1756946690, "avatar": "adbad35f882635e7d720804778706a387e7af437"}, "language": "english", "review": "While the game itself is fun.  Having to play an hour to get 1 attempt at a boss, die then repeat doesn't make for a fun game play loop especially when there is nominal to no strength gain between rounds.  If I could repeatedly try to pass a boss like Elden Ring this game would be really fun.  But spending almost 8 hours to get, 6 attempts on a boss that stomps me wasn't a great experience.", "timestamp_created": 1767217336, "timestamp_updated": 1767217336, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "214769006", "author": {"steamid": "76561199467869539", "personaname": "Alan Wank", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199467869539/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 11022, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7518, "last_played": 1787878474, "avatar": "57fcdae4178b3d28f56a35115163e8512793c092"}, "language": "english", "review": "I would partake in a blood ritual sacrificing my first born child just to play this game", "timestamp_created": 1767217171, "timestamp_updated": 1767217171, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.5", "comment_count": 3, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "214768989", "author